[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-france-idex-scholarship-at-c-te-d-azur-university-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-145":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},145,"france-idex-scholarship-at-c-te-d-azur-university-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-145","France Idex Scholarship At Côte D’azur University 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity","\u003Cp>The IDEX Scholarship, hosted by Université Côte d’Azur in France, is an annual opportunity for international students to pursue accredited Master’s degree programs in France. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>IDEX Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: IDEX Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fstudy-abroad\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fstudy-abroad\u002Fstudy-in-europe\u002F\">Study-In-Europe\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: France\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>€5,000 Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 10, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>IDEX Scholarship at Côte D’Azur University Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The IDEX Scholarship at Côte d’Azur University invites international students from all countries to apply for the scholarship for the academic year 2026.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Université Côte d’Azur awards 10 IDEX scholarships annually to the best MSc candidates.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong> \u003C\u002Fstrong>The disbursement of the scholarship is conditional upon the student’s regular attendance in classes and examinations, as well as exemplary conduct throughout the academic year.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>France IDEX Scholarship at Côte D’Azur University Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Recipients of the IDEX Scholarship of excellence will enjoy the following benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Exemption from tuition fees.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A stipend of €5,000.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>France IDEX Scholarship at Côte D’Azur University Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the postgraduate \u003Cstrong>IDEX Scholarship at Côte D’Azur University\u003C\u002Fstrong>, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply to one of Université Côte d’Azur’s international programs.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Meet the requirements for a Masters program at Université Côte d’Azur.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Submit their application before the deadline on May 10, 2026.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for IDEX Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Interested and qualified applicants should follow these steps to apply for the IDEX Scholarship at Côte d’Azur University:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on the provided link to visit the scholarship application page.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply for \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Funiv-cotedazur.eu\u002Fmsc-programs\u002Fprograms\">postgraduate MSc admission\u003C\u002Fa>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Download the \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fforms.gle\u002Faiupt1Kqn4JG6qWdA\">Scholarship application form\u003C\u002Fa>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill out the form, attach required documents, and submit your application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Funiv-cotedazur.eu\u002Fmsc-programs\u002Ftuition-fees\u002Fare-you-an-international-student\u002Facademic-excellence-scholarships\">https:\u002F\u002Funiv-cotedazur.eu\u002Fmsc-programs\u002Ftuition-fees\u002Fare-you-an-international-student\u002Facademic-excellence-scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-16 14:28:04",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Ffrance-idex-scholarship-at-c-te-d-azur-university-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69e0e3e4de3e89.12027277_screenshot 2026-04-16 141734.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Ffrance-idex-scholarship-at-c-te-d-azur-university-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69e0e3e4de3e89.12027277_screenshot%202026-04-16%20141734.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,47,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-k